        "body": "## Summary\n\nAfter all apps are migrated to AKS, remove the Container App Environment and Static Web App resources from Terraform.\n\n## Work\n\n- Remove `azurerm_container_app_environment.main` from `tofu/main.tf`\n- Remove Container App Environment outputs from `tofu/output.tf`\n- Remove SWA resources from app repos where replaced by Ingress\n- Remove SWA-specific DNS records (validation TXT records, CNAME records)\n- Update `tofu/landing.tf` if the landing page moves to Ingress\n- Clean up app repos' Terraform that referenced Container App Environment\n\n## Notes\n\n- Only do this after ALL apps are verified running on AKS\n- The landing page SWA might stay if the apex domain (`romaine.life`) is simpler to serve via SWA than Ingress\n\n## Depends on\n\n- #22 (first app migration — plus all remaining apps)",
